body: "Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/157 . Parser comments include 'export is only available in ES6' and 'Expected catch' around valid try/finally and optional catch bindings. Investigate modern parser support and repository review configuration separately from JQL selection semantics. No bot mention or review-service bypass was requested."
